 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [1041.921875, 1347.859375], "pos": [-2933.011474609375, -1108.4940185546875], "widgets_values": ["人物-人物抠图"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 372, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 184, "type": "SaveImage", "title": "③ 保存结果（白底人物图）", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 人物-人物抠图（白底生成式）\n\n## 怎么用\n1. **① 上传人物图**（全身、半身均可，正面清晰效果最好）\n2. 点运行，得到一张**纯白色背景**的人物图（白底 = 抠图底）\n\n## 原理（生成式抠图，不是传统遮罩）\n- Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 按提示词把人物重绘到纯白背景上，人物长相、姿势、服装保持一致\n- **原图走 VAEEncode 提供 latent**（不是空 latent），构图和人物特征不漂移\n- Lightning 4 步 LoRA 加速 + 多角度 LoRA 稳定视角；4 步 / cfg 1 / euler / simple\n\n## 常用调整\n| 需求 | 做法 |\n|---|---|\n| 换背景颜色/风格 | 改②提示词里的「纯白色背景」 |\n| 换视角/景别 | 改②提示词的 `<sks> front view eye-level shot medium shot` |\n| 抽卡换细节 | 种子节点切换 randomize，或直接改数字 |\n\n## 要透明底 PNG？\n本工作流出的是**白底图**（套装流标准做法，供后续换装/合成用白底最稳）。\n如需透明通道：白底图再过 `easy imageRemBg (Inspyrenet)` 或 PS 一键去白底即可。\n\n## 模型（均已在你本地）\n- UNET：qwen_image_edit_2511_bf16.safetensors\n- LoRA：Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16 + qwen-image-edit-2511-multiple-angles-lora\n- CLIP：qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled ｜ VAE：qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [560, 480], "pos": [-3882, -2020], "id": 186, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "orde